{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(I don't think so, thanks for this.)","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:23:17.856000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877724373010771968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"so, what can I do to help?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:25:43.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877724982275342366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"so Bones... We have to make two more stones.... One for Staaten... and One for Kingsbridge.  I know where.... and what it needs to say.... The cup will be the heart of kingsbridge when it flourishes again..... and since the cup is yours... I want you to be the one to write the words when the time comes\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:30:27.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877726176565690390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Is that what you charged fuddles with? maybe I misunderstand, but I'd be glad to have her help if there's more to it than that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:32:17.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877726637758750781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"It has to be cleansed first.... there is a taint there... something looming\" (radar has not told me it was cleansed, only violet is gone)","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:32:53.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877726787776442388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"must be something with the mothman. we get the little harmless critters but there could be more to is. bo mentioned another thing in there. I think I already paid for the dead.","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:34:10.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877727108389036113","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"once those two are in place, We can repair the first stone in Hampstead..... and set the city back on course\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:36:24.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877727673466626098","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"in hampstead? may I ask, what do these do exactly?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:37:06.670000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877727849308618793","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So the Masons set cornerstones with words.... its like binding a concept to the land.  Without it\" he motions to the window \"the larger the number of people.... the more chaos and ruin.  Its as if magic itself resists a collective of people.\" he pauses \"so the stones set the atmosphere, the mood, the very essence of a town.  Sets it into the very foundation so that we can build.  If you write of fear on a stone, the town will find itself fearful.  If you write of hope.... people will hope..... but if you are too general... or too basic.... or too complex... it can go awry.\"  he takes a breath \"for instance.... in this city we wrote of family, love, and unity..... and look at the constitution that was drafted.... it had those concepts, but was written from a place of fear and miss trust....\" he lets out a sigh \"remember me talking of that at the hall?  What we wrote was too weak and basic.\"  he eats a good berry looknig like he has more to say (giving you an opportunity to interject ask or say something if you wish)","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:44:12.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877729636258295858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"so with more people comes the need for more of these stones? and it's just like building any home, you have to set a strong foundation or else it all collapses when the going gets tough. and heaven above have things got tough.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T01:50:23.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877731192718381086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"the mender nods \"When we imbue our magic into an item, it makes that item much more resilient... and these stones made from hard rock.... should never be able to be damaged ... and I am not as versed in the history.... but it seems the tones over time start faultering.... and when that happens the Tinkerers are supposed to repair them\"  the Mender looks a bit sad \"But the tinkerers are missing... and the stone in this city fully failed.  At that point a Mender is found.... someone friends with the masons.... but not yet a mason.... we arent told how to med that which is fully broken.... it is so rare... and so unique to each stone... that there isn't a formula to do it.... When I got here I saw this was 5 cities in one... and so I realized we cant fix the broken one.... until we first set each broken community.... and we create a web of stones.... allowing us to finally fix the stone of Hampstead\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:06:15.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877735183925780491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"like a splint on a broken bone.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:08:23.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877735719433551872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Perfect metaphor... so that is what we will do....\"  he smiles \"I realize I have 5 menders now, and 5 stones.  You will each get to set one it seems\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:11:08.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877736412479356947","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"bones chuckles \"rather poetic.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:11:54.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877736605736120361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"It also means the five of you will be able to see to matters once I am done\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:12:58.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877736875891236994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"got somewhere to be once it's over?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:13:45.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877737073740750918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"He shrugs \"I was sent here to do a job.... and was told I am bound to war..... I died in war.... I spent the afterlife helping in war.... either way... whether the war ends or the job is done, I am gone soon.  All I can do is hope I have given you all the tools needed.... and set you on a good path... before my time is up.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:15:46.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877737578806251681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"bones ponders that for a fair minute. he pulls out two drachmae. \"So in the end, just another good man survived by what he left behind.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:18:39.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877738304676704356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"the Mender considers Bones \"I am just a man.... and it wouldn't be the first time I was survived.... but my hope is that the faith can spread.... that I can become a part of everyone.... If enough people believe in what I have tried teaching....\" he trails off","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:22:10.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877739191809769543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"after a moment \"If we succeed here... people wont have to pay to see the other side.... they will hopefully see their loved ones.... and be reunited with those they left behind someday.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:23:59.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877739645385990144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I have seen the fields of Elysium... I have walked the blessed Isles.... I have seen the pits of Hades.... There is so much after all of this.....\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:25:43.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877740081924960267","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"My hope is someday the war may end.... people find peace....\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:26:27.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877740269192220753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"anyway.... this time... I leave some sort of legacy behind\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:27:34.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877740547660472341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I used to be andross, who did you used to be?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:32:24.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877741766416171069","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Sandigil.... I had many titles.... but my given name was Sandigil\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:33:13.789000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877741972029313045","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he nods \"If nothing else. You'll be remembered through us.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:34:44.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877742354029768746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he holds out his hand \"Likewise... I imagine Angels will be hearing of Bones the Shadow Hand\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:36:12.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877742723531157574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he chuckles \"that's a silly name, this shadow thing only happened yesterday and who's to say it will even stick.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:37:52.095000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877743139329286204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"The mender laughs \"You are a shadow.... and I remember your disembodied hand\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:38:42.205000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877743349505855569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"my people add to their name as things change..... His Excellency Sandigil.... Sandigil of Roanoke.... that sort of thing.... its who you are in the moment.... embrace it\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T02:40:24.474000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877743778453139476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
